{"4986360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Untitled Shop Game", "steam_appid": 4986360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5081890], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Welcome to the Untitled Shop Game!</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE YOUR OWN SHOP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small area, one shelf and just few licences. Earn money and complete simple missions to unlock new products to sell. Hire workers to make things easier and don't forget to pay your bills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4986360/extras/ecdedbb96fe6d652c6e520f89ad05434.avif?t=1786739573\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE TUTORIAL SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is more annoying than forced tutorials, right? That's why you have an adorable assistant: android named Julia. If you need help, just ask her: how to order goods, how to change the price of products or what to do with thievs? She knows it all. Oh, one more thing. She's more than a animated tutorial. You can talk to her about her, some random topics or about you. Julia happens to be surprisingly curious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4986360/extras/65c9df4339639a9ba206be12b7cb6415.avif?t=1786739573\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLEASH YOUR CREATIVITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The area around your shop is empty at first, but you can place dozens of different decorations to make it truly &quot;your place.&quot; There are no limits or categories here. If for some reason you decide to put a toilet on the sidewalk... I'm not judging. You probably have your reasons for doing so. Oh, that's not all! We've prepared two... yes... two houses for you! One of them has no interior walls. Why? Because you can buy them and decide the layout! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4986360/extras/7287e8b2b4bcee703f193a7585658bc2.avif?t=1786739573\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A CITY THAT LIVES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk around a small section of a fictional Polish city that lives: animated traffic, planes, NPCs you can talk to.  Untitled Shop Game uses the dialogue system known from Disco Elysium, realistic material and hair physics, and basic NPC facial expressions. No more mannequins visiting your shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4986360/extras/474dc4035f11aef2a6319e2003d0628a.avif?t=1786739573\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>So, will you accept the invitation to become a shop manager?</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Welcome to the Untitled Shop Game!</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE YOUR OWN SHOP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small area, one shelf and just few licences. Earn money and complete simple missions to unlock new products to sell. Hire workers to make things easier and don't forget to pay your bills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4986360/extras/ecdedbb96fe6d652c6e520f89ad05434.avif?t=1786739573\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE TUTORIAL SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is more annoying than forced tutorials, right? That's why you have an adorable assistant: android named Julia. If you need help, just ask her: how to order goods, how to change the price of products or what to do with thievs? She knows it all. Oh, one more thing. She's more than a animated tutorial. You can talk to her about her, some random topics or about you. Julia happens to be surprisingly curious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4986360/extras/65c9df4339639a9ba206be12b7cb6415.avif?t=1786739573\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLEASH YOUR CREATIVITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The area around your shop is empty at first, but you can place dozens of different decorations to make it truly &quot;your place.&quot; There are no limits or categories here. If for some reason you decide to put a toilet on the sidewalk... I'm not judging. You probably have your reasons for doing so. Oh, that's not all! We've prepared two... yes... two houses for you! One of them has no interior walls. Why? Because you can buy them and decide the layout! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4986360/extras/7287e8b2b4bcee703f193a7585658bc2.avif?t=1786739573\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A CITY THAT LIVES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk around a small section of a fictional Polish city that lives: animated traffic, planes, NPCs you can talk to.  Untitled Shop Game uses the dialogue system known from Disco Elysium, realistic material and hair physics, and basic NPC facial expressions. No more mannequins visiting your shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4986360/extras/474dc4035f11aef2a6319e2003d0628a.avif?t=1786739573\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>So, will you accept the invitation to become a shop manager?</strong></h2>", "short_description": "Untitled Shop Game is a shop simulator that lets you unleash your artistic side. Dozens of decorations await, and there are no limits to how, what, or where you place items (well, except for placing stuff on the roads). Oh, and one more thing: the game includes a music player with over 50 songs!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4986360/85e15c145caed26c8fe47b0d8c824df4f8051fca/header.jpg?t=1786739573", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4986360/171aa672a58aaeb871530cf490963bfbf3777cbc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786739573", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4986360/171aa672a58aaeb871530cf490963bfbf3777cbc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786739573", "website": "https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61583452521977", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3550<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8  GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060 or Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</str